00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.400
Share buybacks at a discount to market price can transfer value directly to remaining shareholders

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:03.080
when funded from cash reserves rather than debt. Stingray Group announced a 15.4 million

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:11.580
