00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:17.400
the prior close. Investors can screen for similar opportunities by monitoring TSX

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:23.080
filings for private agreements with large holders and comparing the repurchase price to the 20-day

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:28.960
volume weighted average. This approach has historically worked best in low volatility periods when

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:35.740
management has high conviction in free cash flow stability. Platforms such as TMX or SETR Plus

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:41.240
let retail investors pull the filings the same day they are released. Seeing real-world

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:46.020
capital allocation like this makes a perfect bridge to our investor education segment.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:52.840
Imagine you have just received a $10,000 windfall and want to put it to work in your TFSA this week.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:58.660
The first step is confirming your emergency fund already covers three to six months of expenses

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:06.120
in a high interest savings account. For most Canadians the TFSA comes before an RRSP because

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:12.840
contribution room is flexible and withdrawals are tax-free. A simple three ETF starter portfolio

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:21.820
could be 60% of broad Canadian equity ETF such as XIU, 30% of US total market ETF such as VUN,

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:30.560
and 10% of global ex-North America ETF such as XEF. Rebalance once a year and fund the account

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:36.580
by electronic transfer. Place a single market order for each ETF during regular trading hours.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:42.280
Dollar cost averaging the same dollar amount every two weeks thereafter reduces the psychological

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:49.420
barrier of pressing buy. Historically these allocations have delivered roughly 7% annualized returns

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:56.160
over long periods, though single-year results have ranged from plus 25% to minus 20%.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:01.860
The biggest misconception is believing the first $10,000 must be perfectly allocated.

