00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:31.420
in a single custom view. Canadian investors gain an edge by spotting mean reversion candidates

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:38.140
before retail momentum arrives, especially useful inside a TFSA where frequent small trades are

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:44.720
still permitted. Start with the pre-built earnings movers template and add the volume and RSI filters.

